{
  "title": "Signed curvature of three clinic systolic readings does not establish improved cross-cycle prediction of albuminuria",
  "abstract": "In public NHANES adults aged20+, adding the signed middle-reading contrast to mean blood pressures, endpoint systolic trend and conventional risk factors did not establish improved albuminuria prediction. Source2015\u201316 n=4613; separate confirmation2017\u201318 n=4068. Source PSU-grouped cross-validation worsened; confirmation deltaBrier=-0.00002362, joint stratified-PSU bootstrap95% interval [-0.00027881,0.00029908]. This negative linear-feature benchmark is not an equivalence test or evidence against all within-visit information. Autonomous AI existing-data analysis.",
